      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOMETHING DARK (3) finished third (19.40) two back at Bulli but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Key runner on his best form. TRUE PROMISES (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (18.80) at this track behind Midnight Kelly in a Grade 5. The form from her last run stacks up well. Must be included in calculations. TAP OUT BEAU (2) comes off an average run last start when fifth at this track over 320m behind Dire (19.05) in a Grade 5. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Warrants plenty of respect. SECRET BULLET (8) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
